As you already had a luckstone, you should just flee from the mines when
you found that lich.  Liches are quite dangerous even for high-level
characters.  There is no use in facing it, especially if you already
have the main price of Gnomish Mines.

The second thing is, that even if you gained some levels, it wouldn't
help you much.  Gaining levels gives you more HP, more Power and helps
you cast spells, but that's almost all.  Low AC is more useful while
fighting nasties.

And the last, very important thing.  *You were burdened!!!*  You should
never ever be burdened except when there is really a good reason for it.
 What was your reason?  Carrying: arrows (without bow), some cursed
polearm, four mirrors(!) and a second set of armour.  What for?  If you
don't learn to manage your inventory properly, you will never achieve
anything in nethack.

